---
// Colophon, not a footer menu. A document ends by saying what it is.
---

<footer class="mt-20 border-t border-rule bg-paper-sunk/40">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-10 lg:px-6">
		<div
			class="grid max-w-3xl grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-6 gap-y-2.5 font-mono text-xs text-ink-soft"
		>
			<span class="text-ink-faint">SPEC</span>
			<span>
				<a href="/spec/" class="doc-link">ANVIL v1</a>, working draft. Fifteen sections.
			</span>
			<span class="text-ink-faint">CODE</span>
			<span>
				<a href="https://github.com/anvil-md/anvil" class="doc-link">github.com/anvil-md/anvil</a>
			</span>
			<span class="text-ink-faint">LICENCE</span>
			<span>MIT. Icon geometry is Lucide, ISC.</span>
			<span class="text-ink-faint">COLOPHON</span>
			<span>
				IBM Plex, self-hosted. Every ANVIL block on this site is rendered at build time by the
				reference implementation.
			</span>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
